---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: supplyTokens(tokenAmount, legionFeeTokens, referrerFeeTokens)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_published: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_published --> q_check_not_supplied: resultsPublished == true
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: results not published
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_validate_amounts: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_revert_already: already supplied
    q_validate_amounts --> q_transfer: tokenAmount + legionFeeTokens + referrerFeeTokens matches totalTokensAllocated + fees
    q_validate_amounts --> q_revert_mismatch: amount mismatch
    q_transfer --> q_mark_supplied: askToken.transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalAmount)
    q_mark_supplied --> q_emit: tokensSupplied = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokensSupplied(tokenAmount, legionFeeTokens, referrerFeeTokens)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadySupplied
    q_revert_mismatch --> [*]: revert TokenAmountMismatch

    note right of q_validate_amounts
        INV-001: tokensSupplied transitions false->true exactly once
        INV-002: askToken balance >= totalTokensAllocated after supply
        INV-003: fee tokens segregated from investor allocations
    end note
